plt.xticks([])
plt.yticks([])

plt.subplot(1,3,3)
plt.imshow(maskimg[350:450,485:530], cmap='gray')
plt.title('Otsu/K-Means (zoomed in)')
plt.xticks([])
plt.yticks([])
</textarea></div><p><strong>Output:</strong></p><img alt="Image Processing Using Machine Learning" src="https://images.tpointtech.com/tutorial/machine-learning/images/image-processing-using-machine-learning19.png"/><p>We will now employ a Canny edge detector which is a smarter Sobel Filter.</p><div class="codeblock"><textarea class="java" name="code">plt.figure(figsize=(12,6))

plt.subplot(1,2,1)
plt.imshow(grayimg,cmap='gray')
plt.title('Original image')
